    explanation: "Through the Park: any of the 3 roads to the Park, then either of the 2 roads to School, gives 3 \u00d7 2 = 6 routes. The road straight to School adds 1 more route: 6 + 1 = 7. 6 is tempting because it counts only the routes through the Park and leaves out the direct road.",
    hints: ["Pair each road from Home to the Park with each road from the Park to School. Then check for any other way to School."],
    figure: {"type": "svg", "markup": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 440 230\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" font-family=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"A map with Home, the Park and School joined by roads\">\n  <rect class=\"bg\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"440\" height=\"230\" fill=\"#fff\"/>\n  <text class=\"title\" x=\"220.0\" y=\"22\" font-size=\"15\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#333\">Atharv's map</text>\n  <path class=\"part road\" d=\"M 60 160 Q 124.31 87.11 220 70\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#8d6e63\" stroke-width=\"3\"/>\n  <path class=\"part road\" d=\"M 60 160 Q 140 115 220 70\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#8d6e63\" stroke-width=\"3\"/>\n  <path class=\"part road\" d=\"M 60 160 Q 155.69 142.89 220 70\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#8d6e63\" stroke-width=\"3\"/>\n  <path class=\"part road\" d=\"M 220 70 Q 311.77 94.08 380 160\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#8d6e63\" stroke-width=\"3\"/>\n  <path class=\"part road\" d=\"M 220 70 Q 288.23 135.92 380 160\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#8d6e63\" stroke-width=\"3\"/>\n  <path class=\"part road\" d=\"M 60 160 Q 220 210 380 160\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#8d6e63\" stroke-width=\"3\"/>\n  <circle class=\"part town\" cx=\"60\" cy=\"160\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#43a047\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n  <text class=\"label place-name\" x=\"60\" y=\"190\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#263238\">Home</text>\n  <circle class=\"part town\" cx=\"220\" cy=\"70\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#43a047\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n  <text class=\"label place-name\" x=\"220\" y=\"50\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#263238\">Park</text>\n  <circle class=\"part town\" cx=\"380\" cy=\"160\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#43a047\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n  <text class=\"label place-name\" x=\"380\" y=\"190\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#263238\">School</text>\n</svg>", "alt": "Three places: Home on the left, the Park at the top middle and School on the right. Three roads join Home and the Park, two roads join the Park and School, and one road curves below from Home straight to School."}
